#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:4
msgid "class Circle -- Circle object"
msgstr "class Circle -- Circle 物件"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:6
msgid ""
"The circle object is an `attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_"
" returned by `Image.find_circles()`. Each circle is described by its centre,"
" its radius, and a Hough-space magnitude that captures how strongly the edge"
" pixels in the image voted for it."
msgstr ""
"circle 物件是由 `Image.find_circles()` 回傳的 `attrtuple "
"<https://docs.micropython.org/en/latest/library/collections.html#collections.namedtuple>`_\\"
" 。每個圓由它的圓心、半徑，以及一個霍夫空間（Hough-space）幅度值描述，該幅度值反映影像中的邊緣像素為此圓投票的強度。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:11
msgid ""
"Fields are accessible by attribute name (``circle.x``) or by index "
"(``circle[0]``). The object has no public constructor."
msgstr "欄位可透過屬性名稱（\\ ``circle.x``\\ ）或索引（\\ ``circle[0]``\\ ）存取。此物件沒有公開的建構子。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:16
msgid "Please call `Image.find_circles()` to create this object."
msgstr "請呼叫 `Image.find_circles()` 來建立此物件。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:20
msgid "Centre x coordinate, in pixels. Integer. Index ``[0]``."
msgstr "圓心 x 座標，以像素為單位。整數。索引 ``[0]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:24
msgid "Centre y coordinate, in pixels. Integer. Index ``[1]``."
msgstr "圓心 y 座標，以像素為單位。整數。索引 ``[1]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:28
msgid "Radius, in pixels. Integer. Index ``[2]``."
msgstr "半徑，以像素為單位。整數。索引 ``[2]``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/omv.image.Circle.rst:32
msgid ""
"Magnitude of the circle in Hough-space. Higher values mean more edge pixels "
"voted for this circle -- treat this as a confidence score. Integer. Index "
"``[3]``."
msgstr "圓在霍夫空間中的幅度。數值越高表示越多邊緣像素為此圓投票——可將其視為信心分數。整數。索引 ``[3]``\\ 。"
